more damage with it at no or basic skill level, depending on the
weapon, than with their fists at Grand Master level.  The code diggers
would be able to determine that.

I usually avoid weapons when I play monks.  However I always lose
weaponless conduct because I forget I've wielded a pickaxe for digging.

